<InfoPage path="/withdrawal/" label="Withdrawal guide" heading="Yarrwin Withdrawal Checks and Account Safety" title="Yarrwin Withdrawal Guide | Fees, Limits and Verification" description="What to check about Yarrwin withdrawals, verification, fees and support without relying on unverified promises." >
  <h2>Read the current rules</h2><p>Withdrawal methods, minimums, fees and processing times can change. Check the terms and account screen that apply to you before depositing or requesting a withdrawal. This independent guide cannot confirm a transaction or promise a time.</p>
  <h2>Keep records</h2><p>Save the request date, amount, reference number and status shown in your account. Never send a password, full card number or OTP in a chat. Support should be reached through a verified in-platform route.</p>
  <h2>When a request is delayed</h2><p>Check whether identity verification, an incomplete profile or a platform notice is holding the request. Avoid anyone who asks for an extra payment to “unlock” funds. If the account page and support response disagree, pause and verify before sending more money.</p>
</InfoPage>
